Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.87,0:23:09.71,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}あしたも この村
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.77,0:23:13.97,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}なんだかんだ ずっとHappy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.10,0:23:16.90,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}やっぱHappy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.01,0:23:21.37,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}めっちゃHappy days
