Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.08,0:22:05.62,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}跑吧跑吧 快點逃跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.78,0:22:09.10,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}巫女小姐 巫女小姐 快點逃跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.13,0:22:11.53,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}反正你會跟上來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.61,0:22:14.73,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}熊先生 熊先生 我都看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.75,0:22:17.49,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}果然被發現了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.77,0:22:20.38,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}畢竟我們
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.65,0:22:23.46,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}一直都在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.65,0:22:26.11,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}la se！la se la se la─
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.19,0:22:29.40,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}沒有信號 傳不到這
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:31.88,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}Wi-Fi 雖然是有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.94,0:22:35.23,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}便利商店 都不是便利商店了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.29,0:22:37.74,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}因為是鄉下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.80,0:22:43.69,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}太陽落山 夜幕降臨 山中小徑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.74,0:22:46.89,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}1 2 3 4 DJ here we go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.92,0:22:49.34,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}OK 村民 check it out！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.39,0:22:52.32,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}巫女小姐 巫女小姐 熊出村的巫女小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:55.19,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好可愛 好可愛 還說沒有這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.24,0:22:58.11,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}哥哥也好 姐姐也好 都是滑菇妖怪 怪怪怪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.17,0:22:59.61,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}沒錯 沒錯 沒錯 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.64,0:23:01.05,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}就是熊巫女之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.09,0:23:03.94,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}反正是熊巫女 DANCING
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.99,0:23:06.82,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不跳的話 村 村 村民
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.87,0:23:09.71,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}明天也在這個村子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.77,0:23:13.97,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}無論如何 都是Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.10,0:23:16.90,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}果然還是Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.01,0:23:21.37,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}超級Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.45,0:23:24.15,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}everybody body 大家Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.27,0:23:25.62,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好 就寢
