Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:40.94,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}我今天也有點慌亂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.97,0:01:42.40,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}啊　睡過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.61,0:01:44.20,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}梳妝打扮可不能偷工減料
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.25,0:01:45.95,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不行不行，怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.11,0:01:47.68,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}抓住{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}cute　心跳Magic！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.84,0:01:49.35,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}這件連身裙，很適合我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.55,0:01:51.25,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不快點不行，已經這時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.35,0:01:53.00,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好，我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:58.27,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}原諒我吧　我也總有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:01.14,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}會長大成人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:07.29,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}但你還要待在我身邊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:11.94,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}因為　因為　很可怕嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:15.50,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}微微一笑　很困擾嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.63,0:02:18.40,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}在你那大大的手臂之中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:22.59,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}我想一直撒嬌下去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.62,0:02:25.94,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}等等我　好好地　回應我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.02,0:02:28.58,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}別裝作沒聽到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:34.70,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}即使魔法消失
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:36.92,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}緊緊　緊緊擁抱我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:40.28,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}再多　再多多擁抱我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.69,0:02:43.85,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}摸摸　摸摸我的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:47.48,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}再多　再多多摸摸我的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.10,0:02:57.10,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,
